title: Quest1_Sandwich_Start
---
// Player's sandwich selections (set as the order is placed)
<<declare $bread = "">>
<<declare $meat = "">>
<<declare $cheese = "">>
<<declare $vegetable = "">>
<<declare $condiment = "">>

Welcome to Sammy’s. May I take your order?
-> Yes
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Bread>>
-> No
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Exit>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Exit
---
We hope to see you again!
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Bread
---
What type of bread do you want?
-> White Bread
          <<set $bread = "white">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_BreadSelected>>
-> Wheat Bread
          <<set $bread = "wheat">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_BreadSelected>>
-> Rye Bread
          <<set $bread = "rye">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_BreadSelected>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_BreadSelected
---
You have selected {$bread} bread.
                <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Meat>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Meat
---
Please select a type of meat.
-> Ham
          <<set $meat = "ham">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_MeatSelected>>
-> Turkey
          <<set $meat = "turkey">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_MeatSelected>>
-> Pastrami
          <<set $meat = "pastrami">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_MeatSelected>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_MeatSelected
---
You have selected {$meat}.
                <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Cheese>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Cheese
---
Please choose a type of cheese.
-> Mozzarella
          <<set $cheese = "mozzarella">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_CheeseSelected>>
-> Cheddar
          <<set $cheese = "cheddar">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_CheeseSelected>>
-> Swiss
          <<set $cheese = "swiss">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_CheeseSelected>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_CheeseSelected
---
You have selected {$cheese} cheese.
                <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Vegetable>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Vegetable
---
Please choose a vegetable.
-> Lettuce
          <<set $vegetable = "lettuce">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_VegetableSelected>>
-> Tomato
          <<set $vegetable = "tomato">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_VegetableSelected>>
-> Onion
          <<set $vegetable = "onion">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_VegetableSelected>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_VegetableSelected
---
You have selected {$vegetable}.
                <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Condiment>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Condiment
---
Please choose a condiment.
-> Ketchup
          <<set $condiment = "ketchup">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_CondimentSelected>>
-> Mustard
          <<set $condiment = "mustard">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_CondimentSelected>>
-> Mayonnaise
          <<set $condiment = "mayonnaise">>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_CondimentSelected>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_CondimentSelected
---
You have selected {$condiment}.
                <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_ConfirmOrder>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_ConfirmOrder
---
You've selected {$bread} bread, {$meat}, {$cheese} cheese, {$vegetable} and {$condiment}. Is that correct?

-> Yes
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_NewSandwich>>
-> No
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_FixMeat>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_FixMeat
---
Sorry, I got your meat wrong. Please tell me which one you wanted.

-> Ham
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_NewSandwich>>
-> Turkey
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_NewSandwich>>
-> Pastrami
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_NewSandwich>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_NewSandwich
---
Would you like to make a new sandwich?
-> Yes
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Pay>>
-> No
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_Pay>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_Pay
---
That will be $10. Would you like to pay with cash or credit?
<<if $enoughmoney == false>>
          <<jump Quest1_Sandwich_NotEnough>>
<<else>>
    Thank you for dining at Sammy's. We hope to see you again.
<<endif>>
===

title: Quest1_Sandwich_NotEnough
---
Sorry, you don't have enough money. Come back later once you have enough money.
===
